Package: swbrd-cert-rotate
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Evan Brass <brassevan@gmail.com>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: swbrd-common (>= @COMPAT@), systemd, init-system-helpers (>= 1.54), libc6 (>= 2.38)
Homepage: https://github.com/evan-brass/swbrd
Description: Deterministic DTLS certificate rotation for swbrd
 Regenerates the January and July certificates that swbrd-dtls-proxy serves and
 that every client derives independently.  The generator is a pure function of
 (year, month), so the daily timer rewrites identical bytes on all but the two
 days a year a certificate actually turns over.
 .
 Built for one private host and not fit for redistribution; see
 /usr/share/doc/swbrd-cert-rotate/copyright.
